---

This project is a port of Charles Vestal's schwung-webstream
(https://github.com/charlesvestal/schwung-webstream) from Ableton Move to
the Akai Force/MockbaMod. The DSP core (src/dsp/yt_stream_plugin.c,
src/dsp/gain_state.h), the plugin ABI header (src/include/plugin_api_v1.h),
and the provider daemon (src/bin/yt_dlp_daemon.py) are vendored
near-verbatim from that project and remain MIT licensed by Charles Vestal —
see UPSTREAM_LICENSE.txt for the original license text and
UPSTREAM_THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for that project's own third-party notices
(yt-dlp, ffmpeg, and friends). Everything else in this repository (the
Force host shim, web GUI, shadow GUI page, build/deploy scripts) is new
code written for this port, MIT licensed as above.
